msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: debugger.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "Type: one of: Invalid, File:Line, Watchpoint, Address, Function"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: debugger.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Status. Values are:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: debugger.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "Active"
msgstr "Actiu"

#. Tag: para
#: debugger.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Disabled: Each breakpoint may be <quote>enabled</quote> or <quote>disabled</"
"quote>; if disabled, it has no effect on your program until you enable it "
"again."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: debugger.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pending (add): a breakpoint is marked like this if no debugging information "
"is available. From GDB Info page: <blockquote><para>If a specified "
"breakpoint location cannot be found, it may be due to the fact that the "
"location is in a shared library that is yet to be loaded. In such a case, "
"you may want GDB to create a special breakpoint (known as a <quote>pending "
"breakpoint</quote>) that attempts to resolve itself in the future when an "
"appropriate shared library gets loaded.</para> </blockquote>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: debugger.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pending (clear)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: debugger.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pending (modify)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: debugger.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Location in the format filename:linenumber"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: debugger.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "Condicion"

#. Tag: para
#: debugger.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ignore Count: If this is a number <varname>COUNT</varname> greater than "
"zero, the next <varname>COUNT</varname> times the breakpoint is reached, "
"your program's execution does not stop; other than to decrement the ignore "
"count, <application>gdb</application> takes no action."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: debugger.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hits: counts how many times a breakopint has been hit."
msgstr ""

